[1.0, 2.5]\n      n_exp_positive_p_below_010: [1, 2]\n      c0_scaling_distinct_levels: [1, 2]\n      discordant_sica_winrate: [0.55, 0.70]\n    narrative_direction: \"从 'structural impossibility' reframe 为 'first systematic empirical survey of symbolic consensus across models, domains, and operating conditions'。放弃 'capability trap' 作为 mechanism claim, 保留为 descriptive label。Hero figure 方案 B: temperature × model response-surface heatmap (展示 SICA-SC gap 的 landscape, 绝大部分区域 ≈ 0 但角落有边际正值)。若 T=1.0 正向: 加 'boundary conditions' 节 — high T 部分打破 trap 但伴随 extraction rate 下降 + output coherence 退化, 得出 'the overhead negates the marginal gain' 结论。Title 改为 'When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? A Systematic Empirical Study'。仍冲 EMNLP, novelty 从 mechanism identification 转向 comprehensive negative-result coverage + practical operating guidelines (C0 gate + temperature-overhead tradeoff)。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18266,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18266},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a2aee3a-fcaf-4a3f-81f9-66dd2db794c2","uuid":"9e36ddd9-4873-4261-8d48-b935a6a5b7ca"}
